        "original_id": "1e902d16-0352-54f3-bca1-12b1cb0a909d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Finish What Ya Started, OU812\n- People: Sammy Hagar\n- Organizations: Van Halen\n\nFacts:\n- OU812 is the eighth studio album by American hard rock band Van Halen, and it was released in 1988.\n- OU812 is the second Van Halen album to feature vocalist Sammy Hagar.\n- OU812 is pronounced \"Oh You Ate One Too.\"\n- Finish What Ya Started is a Van Halen song.\n- Finish What Ya Started is one of only two Van Halen tracks featuring Sammy Hagar playing a rhythm guitar part.\n- Sammy Hagar played the rhythm guitar part on Finish What Ya Started on a Gibson acoustic.",
